      "title": "SMB sidsnooping: Remove use of globals in tap",
      "message": "SMB sidsnooping: Remove use of globals in tap\n\nThe SMB sidsnooping functionality was never completed and comments indicate a rewrite would be required.  So remove the globals used by the smb,sids tap to reduce dependencies on dissectors\n\nAlso make it obvious in the SMB preferences that the snooping feature is not supported.\n",
